flowchart TD
    Start([Arrival at Gate 2]) --> Intake[Scan Barcode & Recipient]
    Intake --> CheckMatch{Student Matched?}

    CheckMatch -->|No| Unidentified[Status: UNIDENTIFIED]
    Unidentified --> ManualReview[Admin / Security Manual Match]
    ManualReview --> CheckMatch

    CheckMatch -->|Yes| Sorted[Status: SORTED]
    Sorted --> StorageAlloc[Strategy Ranks Shelves]
    StorageAlloc --> ShelfReserved[Status: STORED / READY_FOR_PICKUP]

    ShelfReserved --> OverdueCheck{Over 48 Hours?}
    OverdueCheck -->|Yes| Overdue[Status: OVERDUE]
    Overdue --> ReturnCourier[Status: RETURNED to Courier]
    ReturnCourier --> EndTerminal([End: Returned])

    OverdueCheck -->|No| LearnerReq[Learner Requests 6-Digit Code]
    LearnerReq --> PickupReq[Status: PICKUP_REQUESTED]
    PickupReq --> GuardVerify{Guard Verifies Code}

    GuardVerify -->|Invalid / Max Attempts| Locked[Lock Token & Alert Ops]
    Locked --> ManualReview

    GuardVerify -->|Valid Code| Handover[Atomic Handover & Record Created]
    Handover --> Collected[Status: COLLECTED]
    Collected --> EndSuccess([End: Successfully Delivered])
